      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think that's true. it feels way deeper than just being bad at social stuff. it feels like my entire brain is wired wrong for this world. like, even if i find 'my people', i'll still just be tired. it's like there's no point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken.",
